{"suttaId":"sn22.131","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-iii","vriCode":"s0303m.mul","paras":[803,804],"vripara":"131"},"segments":{"sn22.131:0.3":"Samudayasuttaṃ","sn22.131:1.1":"Bārāṇasiyaṃ viharanti isipatane migadāye … pe …“‘avijjā, avijjā’ti, āvuso sāriputta, vuccati.","sn22.131:1.3":"Katamā nu kho, āvuso, avijjā, kittāvatā ca avijjāgato hotī”ti?","sn22.131:2.1":"“Idhāvuso, assutavā puthujjano rūpassa samudayañca atthaṅgamañca assādañca ādīnavañca nissaraṇañca yathābhūtaṃ nappajānāti.","sn22.131:2.2":"Vedanāya … pe … saññāya … saṅkhārānaṃ … viññāṇassa samudayañca atthaṅgamañca assādañca ādīnavañca nissaraṇañca yathābhūtaṃ nappajānāti.","sn22.131:2.6":"Ayaṃ vuccatāvuso, avijjā;","sn22.131:2.7":"ettāvatā ca avijjāgato hotī”ti.","sn22.131:2.8":"Chaṭṭhaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Spk-iii","bookName":"Khandhavagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0303a.att","from":387,"to":390,"paras":[{"para":387,"vripara":"126-135","refs":["sn22.131:1"],"lines":["126-135. Avijjāvaggo uttānatthova.","Imasmiñhi vagge sabbasuttesu catusaccameva kathitaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["sn22.131:1"],["sn22.131:1"]]},{"para":388,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Avijjāvaggo terasamo."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":389,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Kukkuḷavaggo"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":390,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn22.131:1"],"lines":["1-13. Kukkuḷasuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn22.131:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-iii","bookName":"Khandhavagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0303t.tik","from":390,"to":394,"paras":[{"para":390,"vripara":"126-135","refs":["sn22.131:1"],"lines":["126-135. <b>Imasmin</b>ti avijjāvagge.","<b>Catusaccameva kathitaṃ, tasmā</b> heṭṭhā vuttanayattā uttānamevāti adhippāyo."],"lineRefs":[["sn22.131:1"],["sn22.131:1"]]},{"para":391,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Samudayadhammasuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":392,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Avijjāvaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":393,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":[